---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="A Propos | Plombier Urgent Mouscron : Artisans de Confiance"
  description="Decouvrez l'equipe de Plombier Urgent Mouscron. Artisans plombiers locaux agrees en Belgique. Transparence tarifaire, TVA 6% et agrement assurances."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="bg-brand-navy text-white py-14 lg:py-18 relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="about-hero-heading">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center sm:text-left">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-brand-red mb-3 block">Transparence et Savoir-Faire</span>
      <h1 id="about-hero-heading" class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-4">
        A Propos de Plombier Urgent Mouscron
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        Une entreprise locale de plomberie sanitaire et de depannage urgent basee a Mouscron, dediee a la qualite technique et a la clarte tarifaire.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Company Values & Story -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white border-b border-brand-border" aria-labelledby="story-heading">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-red block">Notre Philosophie</span>
          <h2 id="story-heading" class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy tracking-tight">
            En Finir avec les Plateformes Opaque et les Mauvaises Surprises
          </h2>
          <p class="text-brand-muted text-base leading-relaxed">
            Plombier Urgent Mouscron est ne d'un constat simple : lorsque survient une fuite grave ou une canalisation bouchee, les particuliers se retrouvent souvent face a des centrales d'appel anonymes qui sous-traitent l'intervention au plus offrant avec des tarifs exorbitants a la clef.
          </p>
          <p class="text-brand-muted text-base leading-relaxed">
            Nous avons fait le choix inverse : etre une entreprise locale verifiable, disposant de son propre materiel, de ses propres techniciens diplomes et pratiquant des tarifs fixes annonces par telephone avant deplacement.
          </p>

          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-red pl-4 py-2 bg-brand-surface rounded-r-lg">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-navy italic">
              "Notre metier ne consiste pas simplement a serrer un raccord, mais a securiser votre foyer dans l'urgence avec pedagogie, respect et honnetete tarifaire."
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-brand-surface p-8 rounded-3xl border border-brand-border space-y-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 pb-4 border-b border-brand-border">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md border border-brand-border shrink-0 bg-[#031926] p-1 flex items-center justify-center">
              <img 
                src="/images/logo-icon.webp" 
                alt="Logo Officiel Plombier Urgent Mouscron" 
                class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-xl" 
                width="64" 
                height="64" 
                loading="lazy" 
                decoding="async" 
              />
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy">Identite Juridique & Agrements</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted">Artisans plombiers certifies Mouscron</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-xs text-brand-darkText">
            <div class="pb-2 border-b border-brand-border flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-brand-muted">Denomination :</span>
              <strong class="text-brand-navy">Plombier Urgent Mouscron</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-2 border-b border-brand-border flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-brand-muted">Immatriculation BCE :</span>
              <strong class="font-mono text-brand-navy">BE 0789.456.123</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-2 border-b border-brand-border flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-brand-muted">Experience :</span>
              <strong class="text-brand-navy">Plus de 15 ans a Mouscron</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-2 border-b border-brand-border flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-brand-muted">Siege d'exploitation :</span>
              <strong>Rue de Menin 45, 7700 Mouscron</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-2 border-b border-brand-border flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-brand-muted">Telephone local :</span>
              <strong class="text-brand-red">056 98 02 44</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-2 border-b border-brand-border flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-brand-muted">Assurance professionnelle :</span>
              <strong>RC Pro & Garantie Decennale (Ethias, AXA, AG)</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-2 border-b border-brand-border flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-brand-muted">Certifications tenues :</span>
              <strong>Gaz G1/G2, PEB Cerga, VCA, Buildwise CSTC</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-2 border-b border-brand-border flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-brand-muted">Garanties de service :</span>
              <strong>2 ans pieces & MO, Devis ferme, Etancheite testee</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-2 border-b border-brand-border flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-brand-muted">Delai d'arrivee promis :</span>
              <strong class="text-brand-red">20 a 30 min (24h/24, 7j/7)</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-brand-muted">Agrement Fiscalite :</span>
              <strong>Taux TVA reduit a 6% (+10 ans)</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 Pillars of Excellence -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-brand-surface border-b border-brand-border" aria-labelledby="pillars-heading">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <h2 id="pillars-heading" class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy tracking-tight">
          Nos 4 Engagements Invariables
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted mt-2">Ce que chaque client est en droit d'exiger lors d'un depannage a domicile.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-border shadow-xs space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-red/10 text-brand-red font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm">
            01
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-base">Devis Avant Travaux</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
            Apres examen visuel et controle technique, le tarif est annonce et confirme. Vous signez avant l'amorcage des reparations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-border shadow-xs space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-navy text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm">
            02
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-base">Pieces d'Origine</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
            Nous n'utilisons que des marques certifiees (Geberit, Grohe, Bulex, Vaillant) garantissant un fonctionnement silencieux et durable.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-border shadow-xs space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-red/10 text-brand-red font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm">
            03
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-base">Dossier Assurances</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
            En cas de degat des eaux, nous redigeons un rapport technique conforme pour votre courtier (AXA, Ethias, AG, Belfius) avec attestation SWDE.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-border shadow-xs space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-navy text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm">
            04
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-base">Proprete du Chantier</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
            Nos artisans protegent vos sols, utilisent des bacs de recuperation et nettoient minutieusement la zone de travail avant depart.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Box -->
  <section class="py-14 bg-white text-center">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy">
        Une Question ou une Demande Particuliere ?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted">
        Notre equipe se tient a votre disposition pour vous conseiller sur vos equipements et installations sanitaires.
      </p>
      <div class="pt-2">
        <a href="/contact" class="px-7 py-3.5 bg-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-red font-bold text-sm rounded-xl text-white shadow-md transition inline-block">
          Contactez notre equipe locale
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
